    "weakness": "a configuration or algorithm weakness that is true at this line, independent of whether a tool reports it as a separate finding."
  },
  "open_matching_questions": [
    "A line carrying a `weakness` describes two true facts (an algorithm is in use, and its guarantee is off). Step 15 must state whether a tool emitting two findings there scores one TP or one TP and one FP, before running anything.",
